    <summary type="text">Projects, tools, and technologies I want to explore someday. This is my queue of things to check out, organized by category. Each item has a checkbox for...</summary>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2 id=&#34;purpose-of-the-page&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Purpose of the Page&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#purpose-of-the-page&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Projects, tools, and technologies I want to explore someday. This is my queue&#xA;of things to check out, organized by category. Each item has a checkbox for&#xA;tracking progress - once explored, I&amp;rsquo;ll add a summary or link to a longer post.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;self-hosted-services&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Self-Hosted Services&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#self-hosted-services&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://docs.karakeep.app/&#34;&gt;Karakeep&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (2025-07-19) Read-later and&#xA;bookmarking service to replace texting links to myself. Want to explore the app&#xA;and extension, set up RSS feeds for lists.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;I am running Karakeep, would like to hook it into my blog like &lt;code&gt;thoughts&lt;/code&gt; but just haven&amp;rsquo;t taken the time to do it&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/pypeaday/rybbit&#34;&gt;Rybbit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (2025-08-23)&#xA;Self-hosted Google Analytics alternative. Forked the repo, want to try on&#xA;quadtask.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/lissy93/domain-locker&#34;&gt;Domain Locker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;(2025-12-09) Domain monitoring service. Stood it up and want to see how it&#xA;fits into the lab over the next year.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;platform-devops&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Platform &amp;amp; DevOps&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#platform-devops&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/pypeaday/komodo&#34;&gt;Komodo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (2025-08-23)&#xA;Platform-as-a-product tool that aligns with my vision for &amp;ldquo;platform as a&#xA;product&amp;rdquo;. Discovered it matches much of what I envisioned.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/ironcalc/IronCalc&#34;&gt;IronCalc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (2025-11-07)&#xA;Self-hosted spreadsheet solution. Need to manage the build, starting to think&#xA;about a reusable &lt;a href=&#34;/forgejo/&#34; class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; title=&#34;self-hosted code forge - codeberg - fork of gittea&#34; data-hover-title=&#34;forgejo&#34;&gt;Forgejo&lt;/a&gt; action for &lt;a href=&#34;/docker/&#34; class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; title=&#34;docker - container runtime&#34; data-hover-title=&#34;docker&#34;&gt;Docker&lt;/a&gt; builds.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Unfortunately there&amp;rsquo;s not much to write about - neat project but I don&amp;rsquo;t need it&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/lldap/lldap/blob/main/docs/install.md#with-docker&#34;&gt;LLDAP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;(2025-11-10) Lightweight LDAP for homelab SSO. Want to get SSO setup at home&#xA;for repoflow, considering LLDAP and Authelia for authentication.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Repoflow&lt;/strong&gt; (2025-08-09) Artifactory replacement for artifact storage.&#xA;Requested a free license and experimenting with it for homelab platform&#xA;storage.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Have blog posts but no dedicated project/glossary page yet&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;storage-solutions&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Storage Solutions&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#storage-solutions&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://git.deuxfleurs.fr/Deuxfleurs/garage&#34;&gt;Garage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (2026-02-15)&#xA;Distributed object storage. MinIO is archived, so looking at Garage as a&#xA;replacement for object storage.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs&#34;&gt;RustFS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (2026-02-15) MinIO&#xA;alternative in Rust. Alternative to MinIO being considered alongside Garage.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;mobile-apps&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Mobile &amp;amp; Apps&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#mobile-apps&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/cogwheel0/conduit&#34;&gt;Conduit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (2025-08-23)&#xA;Open-WebUI Android app. Found it but needs to build and sideload the APK.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;desktop-window-management&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Desktop &amp;amp; Window Management&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#desktop-window-management&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/nikitabobko/AeroSpace&#34;&gt;AeroSpace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (2025-11-26)&#xA;Tiling window manager for Mac. Want to try it out for window management.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;I am using AeroSpace on my Mac - it&amp;rsquo;s beautiful&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://codeberg.org/Serroda/fluid-tile&#34;&gt;Fluid Tile&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (2025-11-26)&#xA;Tiling window manager option. Saw it as a tiling window manager option to try&#xA;after getting tiling working on Mac with AeroSpace.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;productivity-utilities&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Productivity &amp;amp; Utilities&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#productivity-utilities&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/matda59/ChoresRewards&#34;&gt;ChoresRewards&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;(2025-08-10) Chore tracking with rewards for kids. Looking for a way to track&#xA;and reward chores for both myself and the kids; considering rewriting it in&#xA;FastAPI if the auth mechanisms don&amp;rsquo;t work out.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/Lifailon/lazyjournal&#34;&gt;Lazyjournal&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (2025-11-15)&#xA;TUI for host logs. Lazydocker/git-inspired tool for viewing host logs that I&#xA;learned about.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-opencode&#34;&gt;Oh My Opencode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;(2025-12-31) Compare with OpenAgents. Need to compare OpenAgents with&#xA;oh-my-opencode.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/cjpais/Handy&#34;&gt;Handy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (2026-02-03) STT tool for&#xA;voice control. Started using for speech-to-text on work Mac to talk to neovim&#xA;and opencode; excited to explore vocally conversing with agents.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;already-explored-have-pages&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Already Explored (Have Pages)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#already-explored-have-pages&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;These projects already have glossary entries or blog posts:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://docs.affine.pro/&#34;&gt;Affine&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - Self-hosted Notion-like platform&#xA;(see &lt;a href=&#34;/affine/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Affine&#34; data-description=&#34;Mind-mapping webapp at home with native desktop App. Like Notion but with diagram support&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-10-13&#34; data-preview=&#34;Mind-mapping webapp at home with native desktop App. Like Notion but with diagram support&#34;&gt;Affine&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/caronc/apprise&#34;&gt;Apprise&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - Centralized&#xA;notification service (see &lt;a href=&#34;/apprise/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;apprise&#34; data-description=&#34;Apprise - github project that&amp;#39;s awesome about notifications&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-09-02&#34; data-preview=&#34;Apprise - github project that&amp;#39;s awesome about notifications&#34;&gt;apprise&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://forgejo.org/&#34;&gt;Forgejo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - Self-hosted Git forge (see&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;/forgejo/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;forgejo&#34; data-description=&#34;self-hosted code forge - codeberg - fork of gittea&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-08-20&#34; data-preview=&#34;self-hosted code forge - codeberg - fork of gittea&#34;&gt;forgejo&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;</content>
